    {
      "version": "1.5",
      "releaseNotes": "New:\n- Settings Menu! Adapt the game to your liking!\n- Color palettes! Colors will change the more points you get! Or select a fixed color palette on the new settings menu.\n- Max Speed stat.\n- Pause on double tap.\n- Instructions before starting the game.\n\nUpdated:\n- Colors revised to be friendly to color blind folks! This is a continuous work though, feel free to leave any feedback about them.\n- Default speed increased by x3.\n- Start by swiping in the direction you want to go!\n- Back button moved to the pause screen to avoid losing score by mistake.\n\nBug fixing:\n- Removed swipe navigation on game view\n\n\nDev Note:\nThis was not the original changes I had in mind, but I feel like they are good quality of life improvement while I'm still working on V2 of the game. I'm excited about it and can't wait to show you! Thanks for playing!",
      "seenAt": "2023-06-20T20:22:08Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "2",
      "releaseNotes": "Fixes & Polish\nSnake got a glow-up. A big one.\n\nExplore a procedurally generated world, dive into caves, and survive 15 completely different boss mini-games: from Flappy Snake to Whack-a-Mole to Two-Headed Snake chaos. Every run is different.\n\nNew bugs introduced!",
      "seenAt": "2026-05-16T17:14:19Z"
    },
